ssage": "April 3rd, 2025 update\n\n9 resolutions added", "created_at": "2025-04-03T13:51:14Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": true, "has_test_file": false, "has_impl_file": false}, {"sha": "06b58821ea86304c07f507cc880b370870598133", "message": "March 1, 2025 update\n\n6 new resolutions added", "created_at": "2025-03-01T17:52:08Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0566acdd137ee3f476ab9bdba88cd4abd1cc2ab0", "message": "Feb 1st 2025 update\n\nSix resolutions added", "created_at": "2025-02-01T09:30:19Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae81df25c7b808fbbbf739436ce34780ed5c905c", "message": "Jan 1st, 2025 - Corrected database \n\nBug from the previous commit has been healed. No manual intervention was made, the database has been recollected from the Nov 4th 2024 backup. Logs are restored also. If you want to see the problem that was solved, see the Happy New Year's commit 6dfb2c55b4399e582a4dd84580ecb3e51412dd9f or just use this correct version.", "created_at": "2025-01-01T13:39:01Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6dfb2c55b4399e582a4dd84580ecb3e51412dd9f", "message": "Jan 1, 2025. Happy New Year!\n\nCommit with a bug found. Bug is not programmatic, I guess, the UN librarians have changed the data on the website, because the November resolution has been grabbed only today and it failed with the error:\r\n\r\nERROR happened while populating database: insert or update on table \"resolution_agenda\" violates foreign key constraint \"resolution_agenda_resolution_id_fkey\"\r\nDETAIL:  Key (resolution_id)=(4070358) is not present in table \"resolution\".\r\n\r\nThe resolution's title is \"Security Council resolution 2760 (2024) [on extension of the mandate of the UN Interim Security Force for Abyei (UNISFA) until 15 Nov. 2025]\", and this title is in the database already as logs point out, but the title's id (5790) leads to another resolution id - 4066424 which is \"Security Council resolution 2761 (2024) [on humanitarian exemptions to asset freeze measures imposed by ISIL (Da'esh) and Al-Qaida sanctions regime]\" of 2024-12-06, which was grabbed on Dec 1's commit, this is impossible unless someone has changed data on the website. Solution is to recollect data from the November's backup. Next commit with the corrected data will be published soon.", "created_at": "2025-01-01T13:20:35Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d22fe76bc3793b570218a536ea88f17508e2884c", "message": "Dec 1st 2024 update", "created_at": "2024-12-01T07:47:47Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eb24c3dc57dbfb24c764f621fe01291b4b64ecb9", "message": "Dec 1st 2024 update\n\n9 resolutions added", "created_at": "2024-12-01T07:47:06Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "283a3db9cb5f7145bf96ae315e41e0069310ccd9", "message": "Update Nov 4th 2024\n\n3 resolutions added", "created_at": "2024-11-04T09:15:00Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": true, "has_test_file": false, "has_impl_file": false}, {"sha": "661a8c7fbd70fddf443658fe56f31bd83e825a98", "message": "Update Nov 4th 2024", "created_at": "2024-11-04T09:14:06Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b43811825ef32403fb5ecdf5fc4f31cbe25a268a", "message": "Add files via upload\n\n4 resolutions added", "created_at": "2024-10-05T09:04:31Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fcd934a6e9a50b21f3509f847e211d52abbc5ff5", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nOct. 5, 2024 update. 4 resolutions added", "created_at": "2024-10-05T09:03:13Z", "repo": "un_votes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_fil